{
  "repo": "https://github.com/sindresorhus/got",
  "notes": "Second-language (TypeScript) check. Expected locations were found by reading got source (grep for the functions and classes), not with Archaeo; symbol names match how the index qualifies them. A question passes when a citation of at most 300 lines overlaps one of the expected symbols and every citation is valid.",
